# Claude Science daemon, linux-x64 (glibc) only: no linux-arm64 build is
# published. Values come from the public release manifest
# https://storage.googleapis.com/operon-dist-cf94a20e-f71c-413c-bd00-9e12b1fedf59/operon-releases/<BUILD>/manifest.json
# (.version, .sha8 and .sha256["linux-x64"]). The manifest is unsigned, so a
# Super Cage release reviews and bumps all three together; the guest never
# follows the vendor updater.
